msgstr "Tirtir Doorsoomayaasha Qaab-dhismeedka"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Delete the following Metrics.  Notice: If there are no other Metrics left after this process, the Report Template will be locked automatically."
msgstr "Guji 'Sii wad' si aad u Tirtirto Cabirrada soo socda.  Ogeysiis: Haddii aysan jirin Cabirro kale oo hadha hawshan ka dib, Qaab-dhismeedka Warbixinta si toos ah ayaa loo xiri doonaa."

#: templates.php
msgid "List of selected measurands:"
msgstr "Liiska cabbirrada la doortay:"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Metric: %s"
msgstr "Halbeeg: %s"

#: templates.php
msgid "You must select at least one measurand."
msgstr "Waa inaad doorataa ugu yaraan hal cabbirane."

#: templates.php
msgid "Delete Template Metrics"
msgstr "Tirtir Halbeegyada Qaab-dhismeedka"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Variables [ Template: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Doorsoomayaasha [ Qaab-dhismeed: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "No Variables Found"
msgstr "Doorsoomayaal Lama Helin"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Variable Configuration [ edit: %s ]"
msgstr "Dejinta Doorsoomaha [ wax ka beddel: %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Variable Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Dejinta Doorsoomaha [cusub]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Internal name"
msgstr "Magaca gudaha"

#: templates.php
msgid "A unique identifier which will be created by ReportIt itself. Use this ID within the definition of your calculation formulas to include that value the report user has defined individually for it."
msgstr "Aqoonsi gaar ah oo ay abuuri doonto ReportIt lafteedu. U isticmaal ID-gan qeexida qaacidooyinka xisaabintaada si aad ugu darto qiimahaas uu isticmaalaha warbixintu si gaar ah ugu qeexay."

#: templates.php
msgid "A name like \"Threshold\" for example which should be used as a headline within the report config."
msgstr "Magac sida \"Xadka\" tusaale ahaan kaas oo loo isticmaalo cinwaan ahaan gudaha dejinta warbixinta."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a name for this Variable"
msgstr "Sii magac Doorsoomahan"

#: templates.php
msgid "A description that explains the sense of this variable."
msgstr "Sharaxaad qeexaysa macnaha doorsoomahan."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a meaningful description"
msgstr "Sii sharaxaad macno leh"

#: templates.php
msgid "Maximum Value"
msgstr "Qiimaha Ugu Badan"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the upper limit of this variable."
msgstr "Waxay qeexaysaa xadka sare ee doorsoomahan."

#: templates.php
msgid "Minimum Value"
msgstr "Qiimaha Ugu Yar"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the lower limit of this variable."
msgstr "Waxay qeexaysaa xadka hoose ee doorsoomahan."

#: templates.php
msgid "Default Value"
msgstr "Qiimaha Caadiga ah"

#: templates.php
msgid "Sets the default value."
msgstr "Wuxuu dejiyaa qiimaha caadiga ah."

#: templates.php view.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Nooca"

#: templates.php
msgid "The method the report owner should use to define this variable."
msgstr "Habka uu milkiilaha warbixintu u isticmaalo si uu u qeexo doorsoomahan."

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the distance between two values if method \"DropDown\" has been chosen. Please ensure that this value is not set too low, because it defines indirectly the number of options the dropdown field will have. For example the following parameters: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01  will result in a select box of 10.001 options. This can cause dramatical performance issues due to a high CPU load at the clients side. Try to keep it under 1000."
msgstr "Waxay qeexaysaa masaafada u dhexeysa laba qiime haddii habka \"DropDown\" la doortay. Fadlan hubi in qiimahan aan loo dejin mid aad u hooseeya, sababtoo ah wuxuu si dadban u qeexayaa tirada xulashooyinka uu yeelan doono liiska hoos u dhaca. Tusaale ahaan cabbirrada soo socda: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01 waxay keeni doonaan sanduuq xulasho oo leh 10.001 xulasho. Tani waxay keeni kartaa dhibaatooyin waaweyn oo xagga waxqabadka ah sababtoo ah culayska sare ee CPU ee dhinaca macmiilka. Isku day inaad ka dhigto wax ka yar 1000."

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Metric Configuration [ edit: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Habaynta Halbeegga [ wax ka beddel: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Metric Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Habaynta Halbeegga [cusub]"

#: templates.php
msgid "The explanation given to this measurand. This will be shown as legend within exports as well as a tooltip within the presentation of a report itself."
msgstr "Sharaxaadda la siiyay cabbirkan. Tan waxaa loo muujin doonaa sidii tilmaan-bixin ku dhex jirta dhoofinta iyo sidoo kale tilmaan dul-joog ah oo ku jirta soo-bandhigidda warbixinta lafteeda."

#: templates.php
msgid "Define a unique abbreviation for this measurand with max. 8 letters/numbers."
msgstr "Qeex soo-gaabin gaar ah oo loogu talagalay cabbirkan iyadoo ugu badnaan leh 8 xaraf/tiro."

#: templates.php
msgid "The unit given to this measurand. e.g. 'Bits/s'"
msgstr "Halbeegga la siiyay cabbirkan. tusaale ahaan 'Bits/s'"

#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Shaqada mideynta"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Magaca shaqada isku-darka si loo qeexo CDP-yada ay tahay in la akhriyo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Dooro 'enable' haddii cabbirradani ay tahay inuu qayb ka noqdo natiijada warbixinta u dambeysa. Ka daa calaamadda haddii cabbirradan loo isticmaali doono oo keliya xisaabin kaaliye ah."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Dooro 'enable' haddii cabbirradani uu yeelan doono hal natiijo oo keliya wadarta guud halkii uu ka yeelan lahaa mid Shay Isha Xogta kasta. Natiijadiisu<br>waxaa loo muujin doonaa si gaar ah. Isticmaal ikhtiyaarkan iyadoo lala kaashanayo \"Visible\" = \"off\" haddii aad raadinayso cabbir haya natiijo ku-meel-gaar ah oo keliya oo dib loogu isticmaali karo xisaabinta cabbirrada kale iyada oo aan u muuqan isticmaalayaasha u dambeeya."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Qaabeynta"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Waxay qeexaysaa nooca loola dhaqmayo xogta."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Saxnaanta"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Waxay qeexaysaa inta tirooyinka tobanlaha ah ee la soo bandhigayo ee loogu talagalay tirooyinka jajab-sabbeeya."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Horgalayaasha"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Dooro nooca horgalaha loo adeegsanayo qaabaynta natiijada. Marka la isticmaalo horgalayaasha tobanlaha '1024' waxaa loo qaabayn doonaa '1.024k' halka ikhtiyaarka horgalayaasha laba-jibbaaranku uu soo celiyo '1ki'. Dooro 'off' si aad u muujiso xogta cayriin, halkan '1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Qaaciddo"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Qeexitaanka xisaabeed ee cabbirkan. Waxaa la oggol yahay dhammaan isku-darka hawlwadeennada iyo tirooyinka lagu xisaabiyo ee hoos ku taxan iyadoo la raacayo xeerarka xisaabta. Isticmaal qaansooyinka wareegsan iyo kuwa afar-geesoodka ah si aad u muujiso ereyada adag iyo nidaamka hawlgallada."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Hawlgaliyayaasha & La-hawlgaliyayaasha"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Guji mid ka mid ah hawlwadeennada ama qiyamka liisaska ku jira si aad ugu darto qaaciddadaada xisaabinta. Tilmaamta waxay ku tusi doontaa macluumaad dheeraad ah sida sharaxaadda, qiimaha soo noqda, doodaha iyo isticmaalka."

